**2. Grant.** The Licensor gives you the right to download the App from official sources (sibersentez.com and the GitHub
release page it links to), install it on your own computers and use it free of charge for any personal, educational
or commercial work. This right is non-exclusive, non-transferable and lasts as long as you follow this licence.

**3. Your work.** The projects you make with the App, and the code and content you write or have AI tools write, are
yours. The Licensor claims no rights in them.

**4. The SiberSentez Kit.** You may use the skill and agent files that the App copies into your projects in those
projects, change your copies, and leave them in your projects when you share or publish them. You may not collect or
distribute the Kit or its items on their own, apart from a project, sell them, or use them in a product or service that
competes with SiberSentez. Keep the licence notice in your copies.

**5. Restrictions.** Except where the law expressly allows it, you may not:
- copy the App or its installer and distribute it to others or publish it elsewhere (share the official download link
