- decompile, disassemble or reverse engineer the App;
- remove or change the copyright, licence or brand notices in the App;
- use the name "SiberSentez" or its logo to present the App, or anything made from it, as your own product.

**6. Rights reserved.** All rights not expressly given in this licence, the source code included, remain with the
Licensor.

**7. Third-party components.** The App contains open source components under their own licences; they are listed with
their licences in `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`. This licence does not limit the rights their licences give you.

**8. AI tools.** The App brings no AI of its own; it starts the tools you installed. Their accounts, fees and terms
belong to their providers.

**9. No warranty.** The App is provided "as is", with no warranty that it fits a purpose or runs without errors. As far
as the law allows, the Licensor is not liable for damage arising from its use. Keep your own backups of important
projects.

**10. Termination.** If you do not follow this licence, the rights given end by themselves; you must then stop using the
App and delete your copies. Section 3 (your work) is not affected.

**11. Changes.** The Licensor may change the licence for later versions. The version you have keeps the licence it came
with.

**12. Governing law.** This licence is governed by the law of the Republic of Türkiye.

**13. Contact.** destek@sibersentez.com
